  <para style="h">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Yuda nɛ ji Yesu Kristo sɔmɔlɔ, Yakobo nyɛminyumu ɔ, nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Kristo sɔmɔli nɛ ngɛ he tsuaa he, nɛ a ji Tsɛ Mawu suɔmi bimɛ nɛ e hla a ke, <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Mɔbɔ nami, he jɔmi kɛ suɔmi babauu ha nyɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hemi kɛ yemi he fami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, jinɛ i to nɛ ma ngma nyɛ ngɛ Mawu kpɔmi nɛ e kpɔ wɔ ɔ he. Se piɔ ɔ, e hia kaa ma ngma nyɛ ngɛ nɔ kpa ko he mohu nɛ ma bi nyɛ nɛ nyɛ fã hemi kɛ yemi nɛ Mawu kɛ ha e nimli klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ kulaa a he. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />I ngɛ enɛ ɔ dee, ejakaa tsɔɔli komɛ nɛ a pi Mawu jali ɔ, a na blɔ kɛ sɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ a ngɛ dee ke, ke wa plɛ Kristo sɔmɔli se ɔ, wa ma nyɛ pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wa be Mawu tue gblami ko nae. A ngma bɔ nɛ a maa pee kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ fɔ si momoomo, ejakaa a te si kɛ si wa Mawu kake too ɔ kɛ wa Mawetsɛ Yesu Kristo ɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ mɛ dee ji, e ngɛ mi kaa a le momo, se a kai kaa Nutsɔ ɔ he ma mluku ɔ tsuo yi wami kɛ je Mizraim zugba a nɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, e gbe a ti nihi nɛ bui lɛ, nɛ a he we e nɔ nɛ a ye ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ kaie ngɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ jinɛ sa a, a ngɛ klɔuklɔu, se a bɔni yayami pee ɔ a he. Mawu ha nɛ a wo mɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ nɛ a ngɔ mɛ kɛ wo muɔ nɛ mi wo diblii ɔ mi kɛ ma ya si kojomi ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Nyɛɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko je Sodom kɛ Gomora kɛ mahi nɛ bɔle mɛ ɔ a ajuama bɔmi kɛ yahomi ɔ nɔ. A kpata jamɛ a ma amɛ a hɛ mi kɛ la nɛ a kɛ to okadi kɛ ha wɔ tsuo kaa hɛ mi kpatami he ko ngɛ kɛ ha yayami peeli tsuo.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Kikɛmɛ a lakpa tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ nɔ yae kɛ a yakayaka je mi bami, nɛ a ngɛ a nɔmlɔ tso he mu woe. A bui nihi nɛ ngɛ a nɔ yee ɔmɛ, nɛ a yeɔ anunyami bɔfo ɔmɛ tete a he fɛu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Benɛ bɔfo nɔkɔtɔma, Mikael tete kɛ Abosiami ngɛ nya sae ngɛ Mose gbogboe ɔ he ɔ, e tui jɛmi munyu ko kɛ si we lɛ, se e de kɛkɛ ke, “Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ kã o hɛ mi.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Se kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ tuɔ munyu kɛ siɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a nui sisi ɔ. Nɛ a peeɔ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ a suɔ kaa lohwehi, nɛ a kɛ kpataa a susuma hɛ mi.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kpoo ha mɛ! Ejakaa a ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kain, nɔ nɛ gbe e nyɛmi ɔ pee ɔ pee. A peeɔ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a kɛ na sika kaa bɔ nɛ Balaam pee ɔ. A ngɛ kaa Kora; a tsɔ Mawu hɛ mi atuã, nɛ a ma gbo kaa bɔ nɛ e gbo ɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />A ji nihi nɛ woɔ nyɛ asafo ɔ suɔmi niye ni ɔ he mu. Ejakaa a kɛ nyɛ ba yeɔ ni ɔ nɛ a kɛ lɛɛ a he, nɛ zo pee we mɛ. A ngɛ kaa bɔ kuu nɛ nyu be mi, nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngɛ lɛ fiae kɛ bee ngɛ he nɛ zugba gbli ngɛ. A ngɛ kaa tsohi nɛ woɔ yiblii nɛ a yeɔ, se a nɛ yiblii ngɛ a nɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ ngɛ a womi be mi. A gbo pe nine nɛ a hia mɛ kɛ a sipoku kulaa.<verse eid="JUD 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Zo kɛ hɛ mi si puemi ji níhi nɛ a si ngɛ a se, kaa hwɔli se mu nɛ wo mi oslɔke nɛ he wa si ngɛ wo dɔ mi. A ngɛ kaa dodoehi nɛ laa blɔ. He nɛ Mawu dla kɛ to ha mɛ nɛ a maa ya ji diblii kanikani nɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene ɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a he munyu nɛ Henok, nɔ nɛ ba ngɛ yi nɔ kpaagone ngɛ Adam se ɔ tu ke, “Hyɛ, Nutsɔ ɔ ma kɛ e nimli klɔuklɔu akpeakpe abɔ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />E maa kojo nimli tsuo ngɛ zugba a nɔ nɛ e maa gbla a tue bɔ nɛ sa mɛ nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ gbeye níhi nɛ a tsu ngɛ atuã nɛ a tsɔ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ɔ mi, kɛ musu bɔmi munyuhi nɛ a tu kɛ si lɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />A ji nihi nɛ nɔ́ ko sɛ a hɛ mi. A peeɔ yayami fɛɛ yayami nɛ a suɔ. A hine a he fiãli, nɛ a peeɔ nihi kuasia nɛ a naa a he se.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔkɔ hɔmi kɛ slɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Se mamimɛ, nyɛ kai nɔ́ nɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo kaseli ɔmɛ de nyɛ, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />kaa ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, kikɛmɛ a nɔ he fɛu yeli nɛ ɔmɛ a oti ngɛ je mi ji kaa a pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ji yayami nɛ a ma na bua jɔmi kɛ je mi ɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />A suɔ nya sami. Je nɛ ɔ mi ni yayami ɔmɛ a he nɛ a nyaa; nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ be a mi. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ ɔ, mamimɛ, nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ pee nyɛ sisi tomi nɛ nyɛɛ wa ngɛ mi; nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi.<verse eid="JUD 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Nyɛɛ hi Mawu suɔmi ɔ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ mlɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɛ e ha nyɛ neneene wami ngɛ e mɔbɔ nami ɔ he. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ke nihi ngɛ nɛ a yi mi ngɛ mɛ pee enyɔɔnyɔ ɔ, nyɛɛ wo mɛ he wami nɛ nyɛɛ na mɛ mɔbɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Ke ni komɛ ngɛ nɛ a ma he a yi wami ɔ, nyɛɛ gbla mɛ kɛ je la a mi. Se ni komɛ ngɛ nɛ nyɛ maa ye kɛ bua mɛ kɛ gu mɔbɔ nami nɔ nɛ a na Nutsɔ ɔ. Se nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ e hi nɛ a ko sa nyɛ nitsɛmɛ kɛ wo a yayami ɔmɛ a mi. Nyɛɛ nyɛ a yayami ɔmɛ eko fɛɛ eko be mi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mɛ mɔbɔ nae kaa yayami peeli ɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Anunyami ji e nɔ́, lɛ nɔ nɛ e maa bu nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ be si nɔe ɔ. Nɛ e ma kpaka nyɛ fiafiaafia kɛ ya da e anunyami ɔ hɛ mi nɛ piami ko be nyɛ he hie, nɛ nyɛ ma na bua jɔmi. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Mawu kake too ɔ, nɔ nɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ gu Yesu Kristo wa Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, lɛ a ngɔ anunyami kɛ agbo jemi kɛ nɔ yemi kɛ he wami nɛ e ngɛ kɛ je sisije ɔ kɛ ha kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya neneene. Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>